Sparky Stereo OS: carried from Debian unstable. PyMOL left testing on 2026-06-20 for the flaky autopkgtest of bug 1137219 (a segmentation fault that Debian CI saw on riscv64 only); the same test ran 20 times here on amd64 without a failure (evidence 05), so the source is carried as it is.

stereo-1: one stereo output, the quad buffer, handed to Stereo KWin as full side by side. The other stereo output modes and the eye swap are not offered, "Enable 3D" and a shortcut to Display Settings are the 3D options, and a window that has no quad buffer says so in ten languages and stays 2D instead of passing a flat picture for 3D.
